OL,3,CPlane carrying European tourists
OL,4,Ccrashes in Peru, killing 13 people
OL,6,FA plane carrying European tourists to
OL,7,Fview the famed Nazca Lines crashed
OL,8,Finto a field Saturday outside the
OL,9,FPeruvian city of Nazca, killing 13
OL,10,Fpeople, local authorities said.
OL,12,FNazca's municipal government said the
OL,13,Fplane departed from the nearby city of
OL,14,FIca and was operated by Peruvian
OL,15,Fcompany Aerodiana. On its website, the
OL,16,Fairline said that it has offered
OL,17,Fscenic flights over the Nazca lines
OL,18,Ffor the past 14 years using Cessna
OL,19,FGrand Caravan planes.
