OL,3,CPlane carrying European tourists
OL,4,Ccrashes in Peru, killing 13 people
OL,6,FThe Nazca Lines are a group of
OL,7,Fextensive geoglyphs scraped into the
OL,8,Fdesert around Nazca hundreds of years
OL,9,Fago by Peru's Indigenous inhabitants.
OL,10,FThe lines form images of animals that
OL,11,Fcan only be fully appreciated from
OL,12,Fplanes or viewing towers.
