OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785707279
OL,3,CPlane carrying European tourists
OL,4,Ccrashes in Peru, killing 13 people
OL,6,FAmong the dead were seven Italian
OL,7,Fcitizens between the ages of 18 and
OL,8,F54, two 52-year-old Spaniards and two
OL,9,FGermans of 77 and 78 years, Peru's
OL,10,FTransportation Ministry said. The
OL,11,Fother two fatalities were the pilot
OL,12,FAmerico Salazar and copilot Irenka
OL,13,FGuanilo del Carpio, it said in an
OL,14,Fofficial report.
