CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785707279
OL,3,CPlane carrying European tourists
OL,4,Ccrashes in Peru, killing 13 people
OL,6,FPresident Keiko Fujimori expressed
OL,7,Fregret over the accident and said a
OL,8,F"temporary suspension" of the airport
OL,9,Fwas being considered, though the
OL,10,Fdecision will be made once she
OL,11,Freceives reports from the relevant
OL,12,Fministries.
OL,14,FPeruvian authorities said the accident
OL,15,Fis under investigation. Aerodiana was
OL,16,Fnot immediately available for comment.
